1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,838
Three properties do most of the work.

2
00:00:02,838 --> 00:00:07,630
Swapping the limits changes the sign, and you can split at any point.

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:14,244
Replacing x by a minus x does not change the integral from nought to a: the reflection trick.

4
00:00:14,244 --> 00:00:21,250
And over a symmetric interval, an odd function integrates to zero, an even one to twice the half.

